  "synopsis": "Noa Saotome is an art director at a gaming company. Highly trusted by her boss and admired by her juniors for her work ethic, she is the definition of a successful, high-flying career woman. But in reality, she's hiding a completely different side.\n\nRihito Otsuka, a second-year employee whose life motto is energy conservation, accidentally catches a glimpse of the secret side Noa keeps fiercely hidden from the world. That chance encounter sparks an after-hours friendship between the two.\n\nCan a genuine bond truly form between a burnt-out career woman and a detached, low-energy guy?!\n\n(Source: MAL News)",
